In-Reply-To: <luz2e9_QrVo.y7rbzM74BgAJ@manipulatr.groups.google.com>
References: <luz2e9_QrVo.yeYQ9ulwAgAJ@manipulatr.groups.google.com> <luz2e9_QrVo.y7rbzM74BgAJ@manipulatr.groups.google.com>
